# Senior fullstack code

Copy the pattern in the nearest file. Do not add a new library store shape or folder layout unless this repo already uses it.

Split by job. A component that needs its own hook (`useSortable`, `useDroppable`) lives in its own module. Do not declare components inside the render function. A React hook is only an adapter around vanilla logic.

Keep types small. One named type for state plus actions. Do not write `function createX<ExistingType>()` when you meant `createStore<ExistingType>()`. Export the runtime enum not `type EnumName` if code must read `.RUNNING`.

Keep server and client apart. `'use server'` must not import a `'use client'` barrel. Pages fetch and compose. Mutations live in action files.

Treat failure as data. Narrow before use (`if (!result.token)`). Do not empty-`catch`. Do not fail a whole run because one skipped chunk had no text.

Do not add persist immer animation or extra UI for flavor. `loading` on the button is enough.

```ts
// BAD nested card remounts on every drag
export function KanbanBoard() {
  return <DndContext>...</DndContext>
  function KanbanCard() {}
}

// GOOD
export function KanbanBoard() {
  return <DndContext>...</DndContext>
}
```

`KanbanCard` lives in `kanban-card.tsx` and calls `useSortable` there.

Comments CSS-module extraction and schema vs db imports are other rules. Do not repeat them here.
